  },
  "knownLimitsAndNextWork": [
    "V1 and V2 are preserved. V3 corrects the additional real retired-generation foreground path; final independent review and every SDK/native execution remain pending. Grammar is not behavior acceptance.",
    "GSA Authentication and its actual SRP/2FA state machine are being implemented separately against the same transport/account instance. This draft accepts transitional candidate tokens only through real remote session/team validation.",
    "The normal refresh path requires currently valid installed identity and signing lease. Post-expiry re-enrollment and official issuer-chain rotation still need a separate genuine identity-purpose design; no clock rollback or validation bypass was introduced.",
    "Unknown CSR outcomes remain pending and need the separately researched real certificate-list reconciliation; the Client has no blind issue/reset shortcut.",
    "No Settings authentication UI, true anisette provisioning, real Apple authorization, installation, background renewal, cold userdata or full source compatibility is established."
  ],
