  "sourceCorrectionsV2": [
    "The new Coordinator retirement entry now requires actual signing Vault/namespace capability and holds the same actor busy barrier across its awaited original private retirement helper. Recovery-only instances cannot acquire new retirement power; concurrent operations return typed busy before journal mutation.",
    "Outer fixture cancellation still reaches its actual worker. Only exact owned test-resource cleanup runs in an independently awaited detached cleanup task, so cancelled workers do not immediately fail Vault Task.checkCancellation before cleanup. Initialization-failure cleanup uses the same non-forwarded cancellation boundary.",
    "Final shared fixture cleanup reopens its real namespace manifest before generation/destroy because AppSession may have published using its own actual Vault actor. The nested AppSession helper no longer reopens from a cancelled worker; there is one final fixture resource-cleanup owner."
  ],
